      "content": "## Unit Conversion Calculator\n\nConvert combustion heat values between different units using the following conversion factors:\n- 1 kJ/kg = 0.4299 BTU/lbm = 0.23884 kcal/kg\n- 1 BTU/lbm = 2.326 kJ/kg = 0.55 kcal/kg\n- 1 kcal/kg = 4.1868 kJ/kg = 1.8 BTU/lbm",
